SUMMARY:Conversations on Grief (virtual)
DESCRIPTION:Conversations on Grief introduces participants to the many dimensions of grief. Explore different aspects of grief and grieving in these educational and supportive online conversations. \nChoose the time/day that best suits your schedule. \nRegistration is required. Call 919-719-7199. \nUnderstanding Grief\nTuesday\, September 1 \nAnger\, Guilt\, and Regret\nTuesday\, September 8 \nWhy Doesn’t Anyone Understand?\nTuesday\, September 15 \nWho Am I Now?\nTuesday\, September 22 \nWhere Do I Go From Here?\nTuesday\, September 29 \n  \nTransitions GriefCare provides grief support at no charge to the bereaved. If you’d like to help us continue this service\, please consider making a donation at transitionslifecare.org/donate.
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/conversations-on-grief-virtual-8/2026-09-08/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:Grief Support,Grief Support for Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/AdultGrief_L3halfcol.jpg
GEO:35.7595731;-79.0192997
END:VEVENT
